siriushq/netbsd_pkgsrc
======================

This repository hosts a mirror of the pkgsrc source code, available in
the `trunk` branch, retrieved from the official Git mirror of the CVS
repository.  There are several guides for developers and users, the
formatted guide is available at:

	https://www.netbsd.org/docs/pkgsrc/

This repository is maintained to provide a Git workflow for forks and
other projects that depend on this source tree.  The `trunk` branch is
the exclusive tracking-branch for every dependent.
